  m_Name: Hai_A
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  speakerName: "B\xE1c H\u1EA3i \u2014 Tr\u01B0\u1EDFng ga"
  portrait: {fileID: 3640663352827712068, guid: d9cd513cc127c82479931333a891b8db, type: 3}
  continuePrompt: "Nh\u1EA5n C \u0111\u1EC3 ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c"
  closePrompt: "Nh\u1EA5n C \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111\xF3ng"
  lines:
  - english: Linh said a rescue worker was coming. Since the strange object fell,
      words have vanished from Lexi.
    vietnamese: "Linh b\xE1o s\u1EBD c\xF3 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111\u1EBFn c\u1EE9u
      h\u1ED9. T\u1EEB khi v\u1EADt th\u1EC3 l\u1EA1 r\u01A1i xu\u1ED1ng, ch\u1EEF
      trong th\u1ECB tr\u1EA5n Lexi c\u1EE9 bi\u1EBFn m\u1EA5t."
  - english: Recover the letter fragments in all twelve chests. We need the station
      board to guide people to the evacuation train.
    vietnamese: "H\xE3y t\xECm c\xE1c m\u1EA3nh ch\u1EEF trong \u0111\u1EE7 12 r\u01B0\u01A1ng.
      B\u1EA3ng ga c\u1EA7n s\xE1ng l\u1EA1i \u0111\u1EC3 h\u01B0\u1EDBng d\u1EABn
      ng\u01B0\u1EDDi d\xE2n l\xEAn t\xE0u s\u01A1 t\xE1n."
